// C33：for x in inout v。整体赋值先析构旧的 Str，改字段、借给 inout 参数都在原地；导出给 Lean 检查。
struct P { x: I64, name: Str }

fn bump(inout n: I64) { n = n + 1 }

fn main() {
    var v: Vec<I64> = vec_new()
    v.push(1)
    v.push(2)
    for x in inout v {
        x = x * 2
        bump(x)
    }
    var names: Vec<Str> = vec_new()
    names.push("a")
    for s in inout names {
        s = str_concat(s, "!")
    }
    var ps: Vec<P> = vec_new()
    ps.push(P { x: 1, name: "p" })
    for p in inout ps {
        p.x = p.x + vec_len(v)
    }
    for s in names {
        println(s)
    }
}
